Default color themes are Composery Dark / Composery Light.

Only the ThemeSettingDefaults ids are patched. The COLOR_THEME_*_INITIAL_COLORS
first-paint blocks keyed to these ids are NOT carried here: scripts/rebrand.mjs
(syncInitialColorThemes) regenerates both blocks from the composery-themes JSON
files after quilt runs, so the theme JSONs stay the single source of truth.

